Trains a DINO model on a public Kaggle dataset
(https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ascanipek/eyepacs-aptos-messidor-diabetic-retinopathy) that combines a number of
public DR datasets.

Best model weight is saved based on Quadratic Weighted Kappa.

Mostly legacy since DINO works best in the final experiments but does not profit from this fine-tuning.

EfficientNet scripts are now only in the git repo